6. Complier Optimizations

#pragma GCC optimize("O3,unroll-loops,inline-functions,fast-math")
#pragma GCC target("xtensa")

Effect:
  - Loop unrolling reduces branch overhead
  - Function inlining eliminates call overhead
  - Fast-math enables approximations (OK FOR EMULATOR)

