7. Full ROM Cache (When possible)

// On ROM load, try to cache entire ROM in RAM:
uint32_t freeNow = ESP.getMaxAllocHeap();
if(romsz <= freeNow - 16384) {
  romCache = (uint8_t*)malloc(romsz);
  romf.read(romCache, romsz);
  romCached = true;
}

Performance:
  - Small ROMs (EX: TETRIS 32KB): Fits entirely -> 60 FPS
  - Medium ROMs (EX: SUPER MARIO LAND 64KB) falls back to 2-bank cache -> 30-50FPS
  - Large ROMs (EX: KIRBY 128KB+) falls back to 2 bank cache -> 15-25FPS

